{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん今日はエイプリルフールですが、何か嘘をつきましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！90回目のファンの方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やままるさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/02/2965610/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月に入りましたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝一番最初に笑ったことは、お父さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「やった～通信制限解除だ～～～！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の一言でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、先々週くらいに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱとこんな会話をしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父「ついにぱぱのところにも、通信制限の通告メールがきたよ！日奈子は？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日「ふふふ(´ｰ∀ｰ`)今月はまだきてないのだ(´ｰ∀ｰ`)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父「なぬっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日「ぱぱにくるの初めてだね！！！いつもは、毎月一定のギガの量を使いきれないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子に分けっこしようか～っていうのに！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、ちょっと攻めてみました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです！私、3月"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに携帯と上手につきあうことができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に意識してなかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全にグアムの数日間のおかげだと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電波がないからホテルの中でしかつかえなくて、ほぼ携帯使ってなかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログをホテルの部屋で書くときと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に電話するくらい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月は、東北ツアーでしばらく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wi-Fiのない環境に行くので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんダメかも。。。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、動画を見る回数も増えそうだし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/02/2965610/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/02/2965610/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BUBKAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中です！！！"}